```text
departments.id
```

So:

```text
Employee John
    ↓
department_id = 1
    ↓
Department IT
```

---

## projects

```text
id
name
description
created_at
updated_at
```

Example:

```text
id | name
---|----------------------
1  | E-commerce Website
2  | Banking Application
3  | Mobile Application
```

