This part:

```php
$table->foreignId('department_id')
      ->constrained('departments')
      ->cascadeOnDelete();
```

creates:

```text
employees.department_id
```

and connects it to:

```text
departments.id
```

So:

```text
employees.department_id
        ↓
departments.id
```

For example:

```text
departments

id | name
---|------
1  | IT
2  | HR
```

Then:

```text
employees

id | department_id | name
---|---------------|------
1  | 1             | John
2  | 1             | Sarah
3  | 2             | David
```

John and Sarah belong to IT.

David belongs to HR.

