# 28. detach()

`detach()` removes a relationship from the pivot table.

Example:

```php
$john->projects()->detach($project2->id);
```

Before:

```text
employee_id | project_id | role
------------|------------|----------
1           | 1          | developer
1           | 2          | tester
```

After:

```text
employee_id | project_id | role
------------|------------|----------
1           | 1          | developer
```

The project itself is NOT deleted.

Only the relationship is deleted.

This is very important.

```php
$john->projects()->detach($project2->id);
```

does NOT delete:

```text
projects.id = 2
```

It only removes:

```text
employee_id = 1
project_id = 2
```

from the pivot table.

