Suppose John is currently:

```text
Project 1 → developer
```

and we want to change his role to:

```text
tester
```

Use:

```php
$john->projects()->updateExistingPivot(
    $project1->id,
    [
        'role' => 'tester',
    ]
);
```

Before:

```text
employee_id | project_id | role
------------|------------|----------
1           | 1          | developer
```

After:

```text
employee_id | project_id | role
------------|------------|----------
1           | 1          | tester
```

